tton \"高清架构图 (ASCII)\"\n        - button \"高清架构图 (Mermaid)\"\n      - generic: 专题\n      - list:\n        - button \"Chat 模式对照\"\n        - button \"ReAct 自进化闭环\"\n        - button \"器官分层(维护)\"\n        - button \"模块地图\"\n      - generic: 核心器官\n      - list:\n        - button \"🧠 Cerebrum · 中枢脑\"\n        - button \"🧬 Ganglia · 神经节\"\n        - button \"🐦 Beak · 工具执行\"\n        - button \"❤️ Hearts · 调度 facade\"\n        - button \"🎨 Chromatophores · arm 广播\" [active]\n  - main:\n    - heading \"🎨 Chromatophores · 色素细胞（双重身份）\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: 生物原型：章鱼皮肤上数百万色素细胞，每个细胞下有微型肌肉 —— 既是信号发射器（变色传达状态）又是并行效应器（毫秒级同步收缩/扩张）。 抽象对应：一个模块承担两个职能 —— 腕间通信 + 并行动作编排。\n    - heading \"双重职责\" [level=2]\n    - heading \"职责 A：状态广播（Pub/Sub）\" [level=3]\n    - paragraph: 轻量消息总线，只传状态变更，不传数据。\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"话题 发布者 订阅者 用途\":\n          - columnheader \"话题\"\n          - columnheader \"发布者\"\n          - columnheader \"订阅者\"\n          - columnheader \"用途\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"arm.busy / arm.idle Arm Cerebrum, 其他 Arm 避免重复派活\":\n          - cell \"arm.busy / arm.idle\":\n            - code: arm.busy\n            - text: /\n            - code: arm.idle\n          - cell \"Arm\"\n          - cell \"Cerebrum, 其他 Arm\"\n          - cell \"避免重复派活\"\n        - row \"sucker.grabbed Arm 其他 Arm 资源宣称（分布式锁替代）\":\n          - cell \"sucker.grabbed\":\n            - code: sucker.grabbed\n          - cell \"Arm\"\n          - cell \"其他 Arm\"\n          - cell \"资源宣称（分布式锁替代）\"\n        - row \"alert.budget Ink 全体 预算告急\":\n          - cell \"alert.budget\":\n            - code: alert.budget\n          - cell \"Ink\"\n          - cell \"全体\"\n          - cell \"预算告急\"\n        - row \"alert.loop Ink Cerebrum 死循环检测\":\n          - cell \"alert.loop\":\n            - code: alert.loop\n          - cell \"Ink\"\n          - cell \"Cerebrum\"\n          - cell \"死循环检测\"\n        - row \"alert.immune Immunity Cerebrum, Arms 攻击模式命中\":\n          - cell \"alert.immune\":\n            - code: alert.immune\n          - cell \"Immunity\"\n          - cell \"Cerebrum, Arms\"\n          - cell \"攻击模式命中\"\n    - heading \"职责 B：并行效应器（Effector Cluster）\" [level=3]\n    - paragraph: 对应生物色素细胞的肌肉同步收缩 —— 当一个 Arm 决定执行一组动作时：\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: Arm 决策 \"fetch + parse + diff 三步并行\"\n      - generic: ↓\n      - generic: Chromatophores.fire_pattern([\n      - generic: \"{sucker: fetch, args: ...},\"\n      - generic: \"{sucker: parse, args: ...},\"\n      - generic: \"{sucker: diff, args: ...},\"\n      - generic: \"])\"\n      - generic: ↓\n      - generic: 三个 Beak 咬合在同一 tick 内并行触发（非串行）\n    - paragraph: 这是 Arm 内部 / Arm 之间编排多 Sucker 并行执行的协议层，不是单调用。\n    - heading \"核心：鱼群三原则（Boids Protocol）\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 腕间协作的具体算法，写入 bus 的默认消息处理规则：\n    - button \"Copy table as markdown\":\n    - button \"Download table\":\n    - table:\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"规则 触发条件 动作\":\n          - columnheader \"规则\"\n          - columnheader \"触发条件\"\n          - columnheader \"动作\"\n      - rowgroup:\n        - row \"避撞 Separation 同一资源被多 Arm 宣称 优先级低的退让 + 本地回滚\":\n          - cell \"避撞 Separation\"\n          - cell \"同一资源被多 Arm 宣称\"\n          - cell \"优先级低的退让 + 本地回滚\"\n        - row \"对齐 Alignment 多 Arm 收到相同目标广播 按 affinity 分片，统一 tick 内启动\":\n          - cell \"对齐 Alignment\"\n          - cell \"多 Arm 收到相同目标广播\"\n          - cell \"按 affinity 分片，统一 tick 内启动\"\n        - row \"聚合 Cohesion Arm 连续 idle 超过 N tick 向当前最忙的任务簇靠拢（帮忙或学习）\":\n          - cell \"聚合 Cohesion\"\n          - cell \"Arm 连续 idle 超过 N tick\"\n          - cell \"向当前最忙的任务簇靠拢（帮忙或学习）\"\n    - paragraph: 这是从 Reynolds 1986 Boids 算法直接借过来的，用于大量简单体涌现全局秩序。\n    - heading \"接口\" [level=2]\n    - generic: python\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - code:\n      - generic: \"class Chromatophores:\"\n      - generic: \"# Signal side\"\n      - generic: \"def publish(self, topic: str, payload: dict): ...\"\n      - generic: \"def subscribe(self, topic: str, handler): ...\"\n      - generic: \"# Effector side\"\n      - generic: \"def fire_pattern(self, actions: list[Action]) -> list[Future]: ...\"\n      - generic: \"# Boids protocol\"\n      - generic: \"def resolve(self, claim: ResourceClaim) -> Verdict: ... # Separation\"\n      - generic: \"def align(self, broadcast_goal) -> Assignment: ... # Alignment\"\n      - generic: \"def cohere(self, idle_arm: Arm) -> TaskPointer: ... # Cohesion\"\n    - heading \"为什么不走 Cerebrum 转发\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 中枢脑一旦成为通信中心就变成瓶颈。真章鱼的腕间也有直接神经通路，不必经过大脑。 加上 Boids 三原则后，全局秩序可以由局部规则涌现，不需要中枢仲裁每一次冲突。\n    - heading \"实现选型\" [level=2]\n    - list:\n      - listitem: Pub/Sub：Redis Pub/Sub 或 NATS subject\n      - listitem: Effector 并行：asyncio.gather / task pool\n      - listitem: Boids 规则：纯函数，跑在每个 Arm 本地（不集中）\n    - heading \"进化关联\" [level=2]\n    - list:\n      - listitem: ② Swarm + Blackboard 的 Swarm 部分（Blackboard 在 Hemolymph）\n      - listitem: 与 Nerves/bus 共用传输层，语义上是更高层的\"社交协议\"\n    - heading \"结构图\" [level=2]\n    - button \"Download file\":\n    - button:\n    - img \"Mermaid chart\":\n      - img \"Diagram source\":\n        - generic: \"flowchart LR arm1[🦑 Arm 1<br/>本地 Boids 计算] arm2[🦑 Arm 2] arm3[🦑 Arm 3] arm4[🦑 Arm 4] bus[(📡 Signal Bus<br/>pub/sub)] arm1 --> bus arm2 --> bus arm3 --> bus arm4 --> bus bus --> arm1 bus --> arm2 bus --> arm3 bus --> arm4 rule1[Avoid<br/>避开别人同一目标] rule2[Align<br/>向多数方向对齐] rule3[Cohesion<br/>朝群体中心靠] arm1 -.应用.-> rule1 arm1 -.应用.-> rule2 arm1 -.应用.-> rule3 note{{Boids 规则在本地<br/>决策也在本地<br/>bus 只送事实 不送指令}} classDef arm fill:#4a154b,stroke:#333,color:#fff classDef rule fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#333,color:#000 class arm1,arm2,arm3,arm4 arm class rule1,rule2,rule3 rule\"\n- region \"Notifications alt+T\""